OL,3,GNEWSAPlayer's 10-match ban over
OL,4,Adiscriminatory comment
OL,5,
OL,6,FA football player has been banned for
OL,7,F10 matches after an independent panel
OL,8,Ffound he had made a discriminatory
OL,9,Fcomment towards an opposition player.
OL,11,FAlex Francis, of Salford's Irlam FC,
OL,12,Fhad denied making the comments against
OL,13,Fa Hallam FC player during an FA Cup
OL,14,Fmatch in Sheffield on 9 August, which
OL,15,Fan FA spokesperson said included a
OL,16,Freference to nationality.
OL,18,FThe FA said an independent National
OL,19,FSerious Case Panel found the allegation
OL,20,Fto be proven following a hearing and
OL,21,Fsaid Francis had until 4 September to
OL,22,Fappeal against the decision.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
