OL,3,GNEWSAPlayer's 10-match ban over
OL,4,Adiscriminatory comment
OL,5,
OL,6,FHallam FC secretary Ashley Carson said
OL,7,Fthe punishment was "rightly deserved",
OL,8,Fadding: "We don't support this sort of
OL,9,Fthing going on." Irlam FC declined to
OL,10,Fcomment.
